<section>
    <h3 id="GettingIn">Getting into the Convergence!</h3>
    <p>
        The entrance for Visions of Eternity Convergences is in Leyspring Hollows, the final map of Visions of Eternity. 
        Go to Hall of Assemblage waypoint <span>[&BDYQAAA=]</span>.
        The convergence portal is to the north at The Cannulae <span>[&BBkQAAA=]</span>  (blue swirl on minimap).
    </p>
